status GREEN -- fleet_round_open 41 legs, stash_record 105 legs, shared_pen 57 behaviors, the seven REDS-family witnesses and tracked_link all GREEN on metal; the cold pass will close tree_moved=yes because this lap edited the card while it ran, and the hot pass over the staged tree is the binding reading.
recommend keep-going -- the pin has room for two median rows, so the next lap can book its own finding; the two questions this lap leaves are Keaton's
